pts.jsonl without the pathspec exclusion for it, and never print a prompt whose split is holdout: counts only. The reviewer changes no code and writes only inside its lineage folder. It never edits goal.md or any file outside its lineage folder.","title":"read","metadata":{"metadata":{"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Read file specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/review-brief-5.txt, lines 1-1\n1: Code review pass five of command surfacing. Scope: specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/review-scope-5.txt lists the changed files, one per line as area TAB path, the code this packet changed since review pass four's last fix (commit db14c22bb0) that still differs from origin/main. Review the files whose area equals your lineage label (last folder of config.fanout_lineage_artifact_dir) without its -5 suffix, plus shared docs that describe them. Every finding is P0, P1 or P2 with file:line and a concrete input that shows it. Check: behaviour on claude, codex, opencode, pi, devin, dsh and vibe; whether the advisor kill switch and the direct-call off switch stop every path they claim to stop and nothing else; whether a refusal, a question, a history statement or a mention of a command can still attach or start a mutating command; whether the transcript scorer counts a load, a followed step or an offer that did not happen, including Vibe journal records; whether the doctor wiring check reads hooks files correctly; holdout hygiene, so no tune, fix or report path reads or leaks holdout rows; docs, scenarios and changelogs that disagree with code. HOLDOUT RULE: never open command-prompts.jsonl, holdout-prompts.jsonl or behaviour-fresh-prompts.jsonl except through jq del(.prompt), never run git diff, git show or git log -p on a path that includes command-prompts.jsonl without the pathspec exclusion for it, and never print a prompt whose split is holdout: counts only. The reviewer changes no code and writes only inside its lineage folder. It never edits goal.md or any file outside its lineage folder."}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"path\": \"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/review-brief-5.txt\"}"},"time":{"start":1794760595546,"end":1794760597725}}}}
