{"type":"step_start","timestamp":1794760716612,"sessionID":"ses_e1feefdd5ffeHQJCqAmpoKpkZG","part":{"id":"prt_1e0133144001l0B9k7S7bcSLRH","sessionID":"ses_e1feefdd5ffeHQJCqAmpoKpkZG","messageID":"msg_1e0132520001LOvRLXJaWpEoeE","type":"step-start","snapshot":"1d5c0b3db4f83f4b439a003e0c9a0c89bd82e5ee"}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794760730091,"sessionID":"ses_e1feefdd5ffeHQJCqAmpoKpkZG","part":{"partID":"prt_1e01332bd001wT3CFKYcg33D8S","sessionID":"ses_e1feefdd5ffeHQJCqAmpoKpkZG","messageID":"msg_1e0132520001LOvRLXJaWpEoeE","type":"tool","id":"call_4e41814772d344fda6f665a1","tool":"write","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"content":"---\ntitle: Deep Review Strategy - vibe-hooks-doctor-5 lineage\ndescription: Runtime strategy tracking review progress for the vibe-hooks-doctor fan-out lineage, fifth pass of command surfacing.\nversion: 1.11.14.0\n---\n\n# Deep Review Strategy - vibe-hooks-doctor-5 lineage\n\n## 1. OVERVIEW\n\n### Purpose\n\nPersistent brain for this fan-out lineage. It records which dimensions remain, what was found\n(P0/P1/P2), which review approaches worked or failed, and where to focus next. Read at every\niteration before any review action.\n\n---\n\n## 2. TOPIC\n\nReview pass five of `specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build`\nin the `vibe-hooks-doctor` area. Scope: the changed paths listed in\n`review/review-scope-5.txt` whose area is `vibe-hooks-doctor` — the doctor command routes, the\nhook-wiring check and its tests plus README, the command-reference validator, the Claude\nprompt-submit hook, the Vibe prompt advisor, the hook contract doc, the CI workflow, and the\nhook test files — plus shared docs that describe them.\n\nThe operator focus is the pass-five brief: the kill switch and direct-call switch paths; command\noffers surviving a refusal, question, history statement or bare mention; Vibe journal scoring;\nthe doctor hooks-file reading; docs against code; and holdout hygiene.\n\n---\n\n<!-- ANCHOR:review-dimensions -->\n## 3. REVIEW DIMENSIONS (remaining)\n- [ ] correctness\n- [ ] security\n- [ ] traceability\n- [ ] maintainability\n\n<!-- /ANCHOR:review-dimensions -->\n\n---\n\n## 4. NON-GOALS\n\n- The kill-switch CLI files (launcher, cli, disabled lib) are the `kill-switch-cli-5` lineage's\n  scope. This lineage reads them only as context for the hook paths it owns.\n- The transcript scorer and behaviour-arena scripts are the `accuracy-runner-5` lineage's scope.\n  This lineage records the boundary and raises findings only where a hook or doctor file is the\n  producer.\n- The feature-catalog, changelog, playbook and graph-metadata docs are `docs-metadata-5`'s scope;\n  they are read here only to check whether a doc describes this area's code falsely.\n- Holdout prompt text is never read or printed. Corpus work is limited to counts and\n  `jq 'del(.prompt)'` rows.\n- No code changes: review is observation-only.\n\n---\n\n## 5. STOP CONDITIONS\n\n- Convergence: `newFindingsRatio` at or below the 0.10 threshold with no active P0.\n- Cap: `maxIterations` 4.\n- Stuck: two consecutive iterations with no new evidence (stuckThreshold 2).\n- Any active P0 blocks PASS regardless of convergence.\n\n---\n\n<!-- ANCHOR:completed-dimensions -->\n## 6. COMPLETED DIMENSIONS\n[None yet -- populated as iterations complete dimension reviews]\n\n<!-- /ANCHOR:completed-dimensions -->\n\n---\n\n<!-- ANCHOR:running-findings -->\n## 7. RUNNING FINDINGS\n- P0 (Blockers): 0\n- P1 (Required): 0\n- P2 (Suggestions): 0\n- Resolved: 0\n\n<!-- /ANCHOR:running-findings -->\n\n---\n\n## 8. WHAT WORKED\n\n[First iteration -- populated after iteration 1 completes]\n\n---\n\n## 9. WHAT FAILED\n\n[First iteration -- populated after iteration 1 completes]\n\n---\n\n<!-- ANCHOR:exhausted-approaches -->\n## 10. EXHAUSTED APPROACHES (do not retry)\n\n[Populated when a review approach has been tried from multiple angles without yielding new findings]\n\n<!-- /ANCHOR:exhausted-approaches -->\n\n---\n\n## 10A. SATURATED / SWEPT DIMENSIONS AND EXPANSION FRONTIER\n- Completed pivots: 0\n- Failed pivots: 0\n- Audited overrides: 0\n- Swept: none yet\n- Pivot lineage: none yet\n- Remaining frontier: none recorded\n\n---\n\n## 11. RULED OUT DIRECTIONS\n\n[Review angles that were investigated and definitively eliminated]\n\n---\n\n<!-- ANCHOR:next-focus -->\n## 12. NEXT FOCUS\n- Dimension: correctness\n- Focus area: the doctor hook-wiring check and its tests, then the hook entry points.\n- Reason: initialize the pass-five lineage; the first iteration reads the doctor scripts.\n- Rotation status: none complete.\n- Blocked/productive carry-forward: none yet.\n- Required evidence: file:line in the changed files plus a concrete failing input.\n\n<!-- /ANCHOR:next-focus -->\n\n---\n\n## 13. KNOWN CONTEXT\n\n### Bounded Context Snapshot\n\n- Target pointers: `.skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/hook-wiring-check.cjs`,\n  `.skilled/commands/doctor/_routes.yaml`,\n  `.skilled/commands/scripts/validate-command-references.cjs`,\n  `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/hooks/claude/user-prompt-submit.ts`,\n  `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/hooks/vibe/prompt-advisor.mjs`,\n  `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/hooks/skill-advisor-hook.md`, and the hook/doctor tests.\n- Behavior claims: `review/review-brief-5.txt`; the hook contract doc; the doctor routes file.\n- Reuse and conventions: hook scripts are standalone Node/TS entry points fed a JSON event on\n  stdin; doctor scripts are plain Node CommonJS with node:test suites.\n- Review risks and gaps: no live Vibe or Claude session is available; claims rest on the hook\n  entry points and their test doubles. The transcript scorer belongs to another lineage.\n- Out of scope: launcher/kill-switch CLI internals, scorer arithmetic, holdout prompt text.\n\n---\n\n<!-- ANCHOR:cross-reference-status -->\n## 14. CROSS-REFERENCE STATUS\n\n| Protocol | Level | Status | Iteration | Notes |\n|----------|-------|--------|-----------|-------|\n| `spec_code` | core | pending | - | Not yet checked. |\n| `checklist_evidence` | core | pending | - | Not yet checked. |\n| `skill_agent` | overlay | pending | - | Not yet checked. |\n| `agent_cross_runtime` | overlay | pending | - | Not yet checked. |\n| `feature_catalog_code` | overlay | pending | - | Not yet checked. |\n| `playbook_capability` | overlay | pending | - | Not yet checked. |\n<!-- /ANCHOR:cross-reference-status -->\n\n---\n\n## 15. FILES UNDER REVIEW\n\n| File | Dimensions Reviewed | Last Iteration | Findings | Status |\n|------|-------------------|----------------|----------|--------|\n| all scoped files | - | - | - | pending |\n\n---\n\n## 16. REVIEW BOUNDARIES\n\n- Max iterations: 4\n- Convergence threshold: 0.1\n- Session lineage: sessionId=fanout-vibe-hooks-doctor-5-1794760565927-i99t40, parentSessionId=null, generation=1, lineageMode=new\n- Findings registry: `deep-review-findings-registry.json`\n- Severity threshold: P2\n- Review target type: spec-folder\n- Started: 2026-11-15T16:38:04Z\n","path":"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/vibe-hooks-doctor-5/deep-review-strategy.md"},"output":"Created file successfully: specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/vibe-hooks-doctor-5/deep-review-strategy.md","title":"write","metadata":{"metadata":{"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Created file successfully: specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/vibe-hooks-doctor-5/deep-review-strategy.md"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"content\":\"---\\ntitle: Deep Review Strategy - vibe-hooks-doctor-5 lineage\\ndescription: Runtime strategy tracking review progress for the vibe-hooks-doctor fan-out lineage, fifth pass of command surfacing.\\nversion: 1.11.14.0\\n---\\n\\n# Deep Review Strategy - vibe-hooks-doctor-5 lineage\\n\\n## 1. OVERVIEW\\n\\n### Purpose\\n\\nPersistent brain for this fan-out lineage. It records which dimensions remain, what was found\\n(P0/P1/P2), which review approaches worked or failed, and where to focus next. Read at every\\niteration before any review action.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 2. TOPIC\\n\\nReview pass five of `specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build`\\nin the `vibe-hooks-doctor` area. Scope: the changed paths listed in\\n`review/review-scope-5.txt` whose area is `vibe-hooks-doctor` — the doctor command routes, the\\nhook-wiring check and its tests plus README, the command-reference validator, the Claude\\nprompt-submit hook, the Vibe prompt advisor, the hook contract doc, the CI workflow, and the\\nhook test files — plus shared docs that describe them.\\n\\nThe operator focus is the pass-five brief: the kill switch and direct-call switch paths; command\\noffers surviving a refusal, question, history statement or bare mention; Vibe journal scoring;\\nthe doctor hooks-file reading; docs against code; and holdout hygiene.\\n\\n---\\n\\n<!-- ANCHOR:review-dimensions -->\\n## 3. REVIEW DIMENSIONS (remaining)\\n- [ ] correctness\\n- [ ] security\\n- [ ] traceability\\n- [ ] maintainability\\n\\n<!-- /ANCHOR:review-dimensions -->\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 4. NON-GOALS\\n\\n- The kill-switch CLI files (launcher, cli, disabled lib) are the `kill-switch-cli-5` lineage's\\n  scope. This lineage reads them only as context for the hook paths it owns.\\n- The transcript scorer and behaviour-arena scripts are the `accuracy-runner-5` lineage's scope.\\n  This lineage records the boundary and raises findings only where a hook or doctor file is the\\n  producer.\\n- The feature-catalog, changelog, playbook and graph-metadata docs are `docs-metadata-5`'s scope;\\n  they are read here only to check whether a doc describes this area's code falsely.\\n- Holdout prompt text is never read or printed. Corpus work is limited to counts and\\n  `jq 'del(.prompt)'` rows.\\n- No code changes: review is observation-only.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 5. STOP CONDITIONS\\n\\n- Convergence: `newFindingsRatio` at or below the 0.10 threshold with no active P0.\\n- Cap: `maxIterations` 4.\\n- Stuck: two consecutive iterations with no new evidence (stuckThreshold 2).\\n- Any active P0 blocks PASS regardless of convergence.\\n\\n---\\n\\n<!-- ANCHOR:completed-dimensions -->\\n## 6. COMPLETED DIMENSIONS\\n[None yet -- populated as iterations complete dimension reviews]\\n\\n<!-- /ANCHOR:completed-dimensions -->\\n\\n---\\n\\n<!-- ANCHOR:running-findings -->\\n## 7. RUNNING FINDINGS\\n- P0 (Blockers): 0\\n- P1 (Required): 0\\n- P2 (Suggestions): 0\\n- Resolved: 0\\n\\n<!-- /ANCHOR:running-findings -->\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 8. WHAT WORKED\\n\\n[First iteration -- populated after iteration 1 completes]\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 9. WHAT FAILED\\n\\n[First iteration -- populated after iteration 1 completes]\\n\\n---\\n\\n<!-- ANCHOR:exhausted-approaches -->\\n## 10. EXHAUSTED APPROACHES (do not retry)\\n\\n[Populated when a review approach has been tried from multiple angles without yielding new findings]\\n\\n<!-- /ANCHOR:exhausted-approaches -->\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 10A. SATURATED / SWEPT DIMENSIONS AND EXPANSION FRONTIER\\n- Completed pivots: 0\\n- Failed pivots: 0\\n- Audited overrides: 0\\n- Swept: none yet\\n- Pivot lineage: none yet\\n- Remaining frontier: none recorded\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 11. RULED OUT DIRECTIONS\\n\\n[Review angles that were investigated and definitively eliminated]\\n\\n---\\n\\n<!-- ANCHOR:next-focus -->\\n## 12. NEXT FOCUS\\n- Dimension: correctness\\n- Focus area: the doctor hook-wiring check and its tests, then the hook entry points.\\n- Reason: initialize the pass-five lineage; the first iteration reads the doctor scripts.\\n- Rotation status: none complete.\\n- Blocked/productive carry-forward: none yet.\\n- Required evidence: file:line in the changed files plus a concrete failing input.\\n\\n<!-- /ANCHOR:next-focus -->\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 13. KNOWN CONTEXT\\n\\n### Bounded Context Snapshot\\n\\n- Target pointers: `.skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/hook-wiring-check.cjs`,\\n  `.skilled/commands/doctor/_routes.yaml`,\\n  `.skilled/commands/scripts/validate-command-references.cjs`,\\n  `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/hooks/claude/user-prompt-submit.ts`,\\n  `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/hooks/vibe/prompt-advisor.mjs`,\\n  `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/hooks/skill-advisor-hook.md`, and the hook/doctor tests.\\n- Behavior claims: `review/review-brief-5.txt`; the hook contract doc; the doctor routes file.\\n- Reuse and conventions: hook scripts are standalone Node/TS entry points fed a JSON event on\\n  stdin; doctor scripts are plain Node CommonJS with node:test suites.\\n- Review risks and gaps: no live Vibe or Claude session is available; claims rest on the hook\\n  entry points and their test doubles. The transcript scorer belongs to another lineage.\\n- Out of scope: launcher/kill-switch CLI internals, scorer arithmetic, holdout prompt text.\\n\\n---\\n\\n<!-- ANCHOR:cross-reference-status -->\\n## 14. CROSS-REFERENCE STATUS\\n\\n| Protocol | Level | Status | Iteration | Notes |\\n|----------|-------|--------|-----------|-------|\\n| `spec_code` | core | pending | - | Not yet checked. |\\n| `checklist_evidence` | core | pending | - | Not yet checked. |\\n| `skill_agent` | overlay | pending | - | Not yet checked. |\\n| `agent_cross_runtime` | overlay | pending | - | Not yet checked. |\\n| `feature_catalog_code` | overlay | pending | - | Not yet checked. |\\n| `playbook_capability` | overlay | pending | - | Not yet checked. |\\n<!-- /ANCHOR:cross-reference-status -->\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 15. FILES UNDER REVIEW\\n\\n| File | Dimensions Reviewed | Last Iteration | Findings | Status |\\n|------|-------------------|----------------|----------|--------|\\n| all scoped files | - | - | - | pending |\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 16. REVIEW BOUNDARIES\\n\\n- Max iterations: 4\\n- Convergence threshold: 0.1\\n- Session lineage: sessionId=fanout-vibe-hooks-doctor-5-1794760565927-i99t40, parentSessionId=null, generation=1, lineageMode=new\\n- Findings registry: `deep-review-findings-registry.json`\\n- Severity threshold: P2\\n- Review target type: spec-folder\\n- Started: 2026-11-15T16:38:04Z\\n\",\"path\":\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/vibe-hooks-doctor-5/deep-review-strategy.md\"}"},"time":{"start":1794760716989,"end":1794760730091}}}}
