{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794761138282,"sessionID":"ses_e1feefdd5ffeHQJCqAmpoKpkZG","part":{"partID":"prt_1e0199eed002XOAOMHfWvnY8td","sessionID":"ses_e1feefdd5ffeHQJCqAmpoKpkZG","messageID":"msg_1e0198c1e001MV2dWy37YkW1Et","type":"tool","id":"call_e7c6f82f3ba844fc9cb98916","tool":"shell","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"grep -n \"vibe\\|dsh\" .skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-runtime-mirrors.yaml | head -40"},"output":"5:purpose: Detect drift across the agent, command, prompt and hook mirrors that .claude, .codex, .cursor, .devin, .pi, .dsh and .vibe derive from .skilled, plus adapter-path resolution drift in the Claude, Codex, Cursor and Devin hook fallback chains\n44:  dsh_skills: \".skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/dsh/sync-skills-dsh.cjs\"\n45:  dsh_prompts: \".skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/dsh/sync-prompts-dsh.cjs\"\n46:  dsh_agents: \".skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/dsh/sync-agents-dsh.cjs\"\n47:  vibe_skills: \".skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/vibe/sync-skills-vibe.cjs\"\n48:  vibe_prompts: \".skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/vibe/sync-prompts-vibe.cjs\"\n49:  vibe_agents: \".skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/vibe/sync-agents-vibe.cjs\"\n146:    - \"Run upstream_assets.runtime_mirrors with --check. Covers the cursor/devin agent, command and skill symlink trees, all four hook discovery mirrors and the .dsh/plugins/repo-guards/adapters/ links into the hook library. Exit 0 = in sync, 1 = drift.\"\n156:    - \"Run upstream_assets.dsh_skills, the command node .skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/dsh/sync-skills-dsh.cjs --check. Covers the generated .dsh/skills/ links. When .dsh/ is absent, report the row as n/a (no .dsh/ tree) without running the check; an n/a row leaves STATUS unchanged, and this run never creates that directory. Exit 0 = in sync, 1 = drift.\"\n157:    - \"Run upstream_assets.dsh_prompts, the command node .skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/dsh/sync-prompts-dsh.cjs --check. Covers the generated .dsh/prompts/*.md files. When .dsh/ is absent, report the row as n/a (no .dsh/ tree) without running the check; an n/a row leaves STATUS unchanged, and this run never creates that directory. Exit 0 = in sync, 1 = drift.\"\n158:    - \"Run upstream_assets.dsh_agents, the command node .skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/dsh/sync-agents-dsh.cjs --check. Covers the generated .dsh/agents/*.patch.yml files. When .dsh/ is absent, report the row as n/a (no .dsh/ tree) without running the check; an n/a row leaves STATUS unchanged, and this run never creates that directory. Exit 0 = in sync, 1 = drift.\"\n159:    - \"Run upstream_assets.vibe_skills, the command node .skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/vibe/sync-skills-vibe.cjs --check. Covers the generated .vibe/skills/ links. When .vibe/ is absent, report the row as n/a (no .vibe/ tree) without running the check; an n/a row leaves STATUS unchanged, and this run never creates that directory. Exit 0 = in sync, 1 = drift.\"\n160:    - \"Run upstream_assets.vibe_prompts, the command node .skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/vibe/sync-prompts-vibe.cjs --check. Covers the generated .vibe/prompts/*.md files. When .vibe/ is absent, report the row as n/a (no .vibe/ tree) without running the check; an n/a row leaves STATUS unchanged, and this run never creates that directory. Exit 0 = in sync, 1 = drift.\"\n161:    - \"Run upstream_assets.vibe_agents, the command node .skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/vibe/sync-agents-vibe.cjs --check. Covers the generated .vibe/agents/*.toml profiles. When .vibe/ is absent, report the row as n/a (no .vibe/ tree) without running the check; an n/a row leaves STATUS unchanged, and this run never creates that directory. Exit 0 = in sync, 1 = drift.\"\n181:    dsh skills       -> node .skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/dsh/sync-skills-dsh.cjs\n182:    dsh prompts      -> node .skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/dsh/sync-prompts-dsh.cjs\n183:    dsh agents       -> node .skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/dsh/sync-agents-dsh.cjs\n184:    vibe skills      -> node .skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/vibe/sync-skills-vibe.cjs\n185:    vibe prompts     -> node .skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/vibe/sync-prompts-vibe.cjs\n186:    vibe agents      -> node .skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/vibe/sync-agents-vibe.cjs\n188:  While .dsh/ is absent the three DSH rows read n/a (no .dsh/ tree), and while .vibe/ is absent the three\n189:  Vibe rows read n/a (no .vibe/ tree); neither reads in sync, and both leave\n","title":"shell","metadata":{"metadata":{"status":"completed","truncated":false,"exit":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"5:purpose: Detect drift across the agent, command, prompt and hook mirrors that .claude, .codex, .cursor, .devin, .pi, .dsh and .vibe derive from .skilled, plus adapter-path resolution drift in the Claude, Codex, Cursor and Devin hook fallback chains\n44:  dsh_skills: \".skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/dsh/sync-skills-dsh.cjs\"\n45:  dsh_prompts: \".skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/dsh/sync-prompts-dsh.cjs\"\n46:  dsh_agents: \".skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/dsh/sync-agents-dsh.cjs\"\n47:  vibe_skills: \".skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/vibe/sync-skills-vibe.cjs\"\n48:  vibe_prompts: \".skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/vibe/sync-prompts-vibe.cjs\"\n49:  vibe_agents: \".skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/vibe/sync-agents-vibe.cjs\"\n146:    - \"Run upstream_assets.runtime_mirrors with --check. Covers the cursor/devin agent, command and skill symlink trees, all four hook discovery mirrors and the .dsh/plugins/repo-guards/adapters/ links into the hook library. Exit 0 = in sync, 1 = drift.\"\n156:    - \"Run upstream_assets.dsh_skills, the command node .skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/dsh/sync-skills-dsh.cjs --check. Covers the generated .ds