{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794761805112,"sessionID":"ses_e1feefdd5ffeHQJCqAmpoKpkZG","part":{"partID":"prt_1e023ca8c001koPDUG8WSSqIqK","sessionID":"ses_e1feefdd5ffeHQJCqAmpoKpkZG","messageID":"msg_1e0239df9001ggVzr4xlVFUWWx","type":"tool","id":"call_ab6df287e680493eb3aa9a41","tool":"shell","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"grep -n \"AC-009\\|AC-010\\|REQ-009\\|REQ-006\" specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/029-direct-call-kill-switch/acceptance-criteria.md | head -10"},"output":"61:| AC-006 | REQ-006 | Given the flags file named in the daemon's environment, When the handler answers, Then it does not abstain, and the launcher file and its allowlist are unchanged | The flags-file case of T005 failed before its change and passes after, and the launcher checks of T013. Observed: the flags-file case passes after T005 (24 of 24); its failing state before the change rests on the verifier's probe of the old call shape, which returned ADVISOR_DISABLED; the launcher names no switch | Met | - |\n64:| AC-009 | REQ-009 | Given the three documents, When each is searched for its new sentence, Then each states the shipped behaviour, the example file's lines still take effect, and the lines `plan.md` lists as unchanged or handed on still read as they did | The `rg` checks of T007 to T009, `EXT` and `playbook-after.txt` of T012. Observed: each search 1, EXT 1 passed, playbook step 1 as expected plain and with the fixture exported | Met | - |\n65:| AC-010 | REQ-010 | Given the phase diff, When added comment and doc lines are searched and the row files, the baselines, `AGENTS.md`, the package files and the touched paths are checked, Then nothing is found and nothing outside `FILES` and phase 025's own paths changed | The checks of T013 and the commit listing of T014. Observed: status names exactly the twelve FILES, FIX 0bc486b1637 lists only FILES and the phase folder | Met | - |\n","title":"shell","metadata":{"metadata":{"stat