o `..`, a dot and an absolute path cannot form a candidate; a missing file is skipped by `existsSync`.\n - **The head receipt collides with the directive store.** Ruled out: the store and the receipts share a base directory but the receipts live under the `vibe-turn-start` subfolder with a hashed name.\n-- **The document line is added before the directive block.** Holds for a headed brief; fails only for the no-brief fallback above.\n+- **The document line is added before the directive block.** Holds for a headed brief; the directive-only shape is the exception above.\n \n ## Next Focus\n \n - Dimension: security\n","status":"modified","additions":1,"deletions":1}],"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Edited specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/vibe-hooks-doctor-5/iterations/iteration-001.md (1 replacement)"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"newString\":\"- **The document line is added before the directive block.** Holds for a headed brief; the directive-only shape is the exception above.\",\"oldString\":\"- **The document line is added before the directive block.** Holds for a headed brief; fails only for the no-brief fallback above.\",\"path\":\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/vibe-hooks-doctor-5/iterations/iteration-001.md\"}"},"time":{"start":1794762497423,"end":1794762498498}}}}
