{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794762533281,"sessionID":"ses_e1feefdd5ffeHQJCqAmpoKpkZG","part":{"partID":"prt_1e02ee02f001s0F6mDAOgl77cA","sessionID":"ses_e1feefdd5ffeHQJCqAmpoKpkZG","messageID":"msg_1e02ecac3001ehKIGFllGbX4Bx","type":"tool","id":"call_f548bd559ad8437da73b9e00","tool":"edit","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"newString":"### Corrections\n\n- **R1-P2-001's registered claim named the current no-brief fallback as its input.** The current handler always renders a status head before its directives (`render.ts:655-663`), so that part of the claim was too broad. The defect was re-probed at synthesis against the directive-only shape the module's own `reduceRepeatedHead` supports (`prompt-advisor.mjs:174-177`), where it reproduces; the finding's id, P2 severity and count are unchanged. The delta and ledger claim is append-only and still carries the broader wording, so this report is the corrected adjudication.\n- The same re-probe confirms the headed fallback (`Advisor: no skill matched.\\nDirectives: ...`) is unchanged by `withCommandDocuments`.\n\n### Sources Reviewed","oldString":"### Sources Reviewed","path":"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/vibe-hooks-doctor-5/review-report.md"},"output":"Edited specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/vibe-hooks-doctor-5/review-report.md (1 replacement)","title":"edit","metadata":{"metadata":{"files":[{"file":"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/vibe-hooks-doctor-5/review-report.md","patch":"Index: specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/vibe-hooks-doctor-5/review-report.md\n===================================================================\n--- specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/vibe-hooks-doctor-5/review-report.md\n+++ specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/vibe-hooks-doctor-5/review-report.md\n@@ -190,8 +190,13 @@\n - `.vibe` ships an agents tree, so the new allowlist entry is not a phantom runtime.\n - The removed `--scope=council` value was not supported by the deep-loop workflow.\n - No scoped file reads a holdout corpus.\n \n+### Corrections\n+\n+- **R1-P2-001's registered claim named the current no-brief fallback as its input.** The current handler always renders a status head before its directives (`render.ts:655-663`), so that part of the claim was too broad. The defect was re-probed at synthesis against the directive-only shape the module's own `reduceRepeatedHead` supports (`prompt-advisor.mjs:174-177`), where it reproduces; the finding's id, P2 severity and count are unchanged. The delta and ledger claim is append-only and still carries the broader wording, so this report is the corrected adjudication.\n+- The same re-probe confirms the headed fallback (`Advisor: no skill matched.\\nDirectives: ...`) is unchanged by `withCommandDocuments`.\n+\n ### Sources Reviewed\n \n - Scoped code and tests: `review/review-scope-5.txt` lines 3-48 filtered to `vibe-hooks-doctor`.\n - The pass-five brief and focus: `review/review-brief-5.txt`, `review/review-focus-5.txt`.\n","status":"modified","additions":5,"deletions":0}],"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Edited specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/vibe-hooks-doctor-5/review-report.md (1 replacement)"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"newString\":\"### Corrections\\n\\n- **R1-P2-001's registered claim named the current no-brief fallback as its input.** The current handler always renders a status head before its directives (`render.ts:655-663`), so that part of the claim was too broad. The defect was re-probed at synthesis against the directive-only shape the module's own `reduceRepeatedHead` supports (`prompt-advisor.mjs:174-177`), where it reproduces; the finding's id, P2 severity and count are unchanged. The delta and ledger claim is append-only and still carries the broader wording, so this report is the corrected adjudication.\\n- The same re-probe confirms the headed fallback (`Advisor: no skill matched.\\\\nDirectives: ...`) is unchanged by `withCommandDocuments`.\\n\\n### Sources Reviewed\",\"oldString\":\"### Sources Reviewed\",\"path\":\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/vibe-hooks-doctor-5/review-report.md\"}"},"time":{"start":1794762530863,"end":1794762533281}}}}
